WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:16.264
[ Watch on KissFlix.co ]

2
00:16.534 --> 00:22.869
(Firefly Theater)

3
00:43.456 --> 00:47.392
♪Neon lights twist into a knot♪

4
00:49.024 --> 00:52.608
♪I rest in the ruins of defeat♪

5
00:53.184 --> 00:55.520
♪You tap your fingers lightly♪

6
00:55.904 --> 00:58.656
♪I fall into the abyss♪

7
00:59.488 --> 01:02.080
♪I've seen this game before♪

8
01:02.080 --> 01:04.768
♪Every single move was calculated♪

9
01:04.768 --> 01:07.168
♪I finally see your silhouette♪

10
01:07.552 --> 01:10.304
♪Just an empty shell♪

11
01:10.624 --> 01:13.440
♪I've broken this game before♪

12
01:13.440 --> 01:15.872
♪Every move was placed wrong♪

13
01:15.872 --> 01:18.016
♪Now it's my turn to play♪

14
01:18.208 --> 01:25.056
♪I'll show you what stunning looks like♪

15
01:25.728 --> 01:28.256
♪When I stand back up again♪

16
01:28.544 --> 01:30.400
♪The whole city goes dark♪

17
01:31.264 --> 01:33.952
♪For the part you owe me♪

18
01:34.112 --> 01:41.088
♪I'll make you pay double♪

19
01:42.624 --> 01:47.360
♪You're just my starting point♪

20
01:51.712 --> 01:52.739
=The Vanishing Beauty=

21
01:53.000 --> 01:55.720
=Episode 21=

22
02:32.619 --> 02:34.020
(Sir, please take a look.)

23
02:34.459 --> 02:36.499
(Ten years ago, Jiangzhou) I don't want this booklet.

24
02:36.860 --> 02:37.980
Others give out free eggs.

25
02:38.219 --> 02:39.059
You give out nothing.

26
02:39.899 --> 02:41.140
We don't give out eggs here.

27
02:42.700 --> 02:43.980
Help me file a lawsuit,

28
02:43.980 --> 02:44.380
okay?

29
02:45.219 --> 02:46.100
I'm sorry, sir.

30
02:46.260 --> 02:47.899
I'm just a law freshman.

31
02:48.059 --> 02:49.100
I am not licensed yet.

32
02:49.860 --> 02:50.779
I can't file a lawsuit.

33
02:51.739 --> 02:52.659
You're not licensed?

34
02:52.659 --> 02:53.939
Then you're not a lawyer!

35
02:54.020 --> 02:55.380
You're just fooling people!

36
02:56.059 --> 02:57.020
Listen up, everyone.

37
02:57.380 --> 02:58.700
These folks are scammers!

38
02:59.140 --> 03:00.020
Don't listen to them!

39
03:00.020 --> 03:00.619
Wait, sir.

40
03:00.779 --> 03:03.020
This is just a legal outreach campaign.

41
03:03.100 --> 03:03.659
Hello.

42
03:04.300 --> 03:04.700
Hello.

43
03:05.459 --> 03:06.820
I'm his college counselor.

44
03:07.020 --> 03:07.659
I am Weng Xin.

45
03:07.899 --> 03:08.700
You must be thirsty.

46
03:08.820 --> 03:09.619
Have some tea.

47
03:12.260 --> 03:14.420
I heard you wanted to file a lawsuit?

48
03:15.420 --> 03:15.899
Yeah.

49
03:16.459 --> 03:17.459
My third brother

50
03:17.980 --> 03:20.300
is hogging our parents'

51
03:20.339 --> 03:21.140
house.

52
03:21.219 --> 03:22.140
He takes it all.

53
03:22.939 --> 03:23.459
Well,

54
03:23.739 --> 03:24.779
take a look at this list.

55
03:24.899 --> 03:25.659
We've compiled

56
03:25.739 --> 03:27.020
public legal aid organizations

57
03:27.100 --> 03:28.179
offering consultations.

58
03:28.779 --> 03:29.860
You can consult them

59
03:29.939 --> 03:30.659
first,

60
03:30.899 --> 03:31.700
and then figure out

61
03:31.779 --> 03:32.820
how to file your lawsuit.

62
03:35.100 --> 03:37.300
- Happy graduation! - Happy graduation!

63
03:37.300 --> 03:40.064
(Six years ago, Jiangzhou)

64
03:42.459 --> 03:43.179
Have you received

65
03:43.179 --> 03:43.860
your offers?

66
03:44.140 --> 03:45.179
Law firms are grueling.

67
03:45.540 --> 03:46.380
I'm going to apply

68
03:46.380 --> 03:46.939
for in-house counsel.

69
03:47.140 --> 03:48.339
A senior told me

70
03:48.499 --> 03:49.219
we should try

71
03:49.300 --> 03:50.939
to pivot toward IP law.

72
03:51.380 --> 03:51.899
It's lucrative.

73
03:53.179 --> 03:53.820
Jiao Xu,

74
03:54.020 --> 03:55.059
which firm do you join?

75
03:55.339 --> 03:56.899
Tell us then.

76
03:58.540 --> 03:59.219
Yihe.

77
03:59.659 --> 04:00.619
It held a seminar

78
04:00.700 --> 04:01.459
yesterday.

79
04:01.820 --> 04:02.779
Wasn't that firm founded

80
04:02.779 --> 04:03.659
just last year?

81
04:03.820 --> 04:05.020
The founder said they're small

82
04:05.059 --> 04:06.059
and still starting out.

83
04:06.420 --> 04:06.939
Jiao Xu,

84
04:07.020 --> 04:08.179
are you out of your mind?

85
04:08.459 --> 04:09.659
So many elite firms

86
04:09.739 --> 04:10.700
are wide open for you.

87
04:10.980 --> 04:11.820
With your skills,

88
04:12.420 --> 04:13.339
doing transactional law

89
04:13.860 --> 04:14.540
and IPOs

90
04:14.739 --> 04:15.659
can make you a fortune.

91
04:18.020 --> 04:19.260
Compared to an elite firm,

92
04:19.380 --> 04:20.620
I'd rather join a new platform

93
04:20.659 --> 04:21.659
and grow wildly.

94
04:22.180 --> 04:23.419
I talked to the founder

95
04:23.500 --> 04:24.659
and felt it's a great fit.

96
04:24.859 --> 04:26.779
So why not build something together?

97
04:27.419 --> 04:29.299
Don't trust their empty promises.

98
04:29.940 --> 04:30.419
Miss Weng,

99
04:30.500 --> 04:32.020
talk some sense into him.

100
04:32.380 --> 04:33.820
Why turn down an offer

101
04:33.940 --> 04:34.979
with a million salary?

102
04:35.299 --> 04:35.899
I believe

103
04:36.620 --> 04:37.659
with his capabilities,

104
04:38.020 --> 04:38.979
wherever he goes,

105
04:39.500 --> 04:40.620
he'll earn more than that.

106
04:41.580 --> 04:41.979
Jiao Xu,

107
04:42.380 --> 04:43.180
I have faith in you.

108
05:05.461 --> 05:08.410
(Couple, Best Friend, Chairman, Parents)

109
05:27.940 --> 05:29.539
I thought you held me back that day

110
05:29.859 --> 05:30.859
to stop me.

111
05:32.260 --> 05:33.140
What I meant was,

112
05:33.419 --> 05:34.659
after hearing what you said,

113
05:34.659 --> 05:35.459
Weng Yue reacted so intensely.

114
05:35.820 --> 05:36.979
There's no need to try to

115
05:37.060 --> 05:37.740
convince her.

116
05:38.260 --> 05:40.299
Better to speak directly to Weng Xin.

117
05:42.020 --> 05:44.299
I didn't expect Weng Xin to have a law background.

118
05:45.099 --> 05:46.099
I thought you lawyers

119
05:46.099 --> 05:46.899
were tough enough

120
05:47.260 --> 05:48.539
to defend your own rights

121
05:48.940 --> 05:49.779
from getting harmed.

122
05:50.859 --> 05:52.020
She had great grades.

123
05:52.500 --> 05:53.539
All her classmates thought

124
05:53.580 --> 05:54.339
she'd join a firm.

125
05:54.659 --> 05:55.339
But she

126
05:55.820 --> 05:57.060
stayed as a college counselor.

127
06:08.380 --> 06:08.979
Weng Xin.

128
06:10.500 --> 06:10.979
Weng Xin.

129
06:12.260 --> 06:13.020
You know her?

130
06:15.260 --> 06:15.700
Hello.

131
06:16.500 --> 06:17.419
I'm Weng Yue's friend.

132
06:18.140 --> 06:19.979
I met Xin at the hospital before.

133
06:27.740 --> 06:28.419
Weng Xin,

134
06:29.659 --> 06:30.380
you recognized me?

135
06:34.459 --> 06:35.779
Has her condition

136
06:36.099 --> 06:36.659
improved?

137
06:37.899 --> 06:38.539
Same as usual.

138
06:39.140 --> 06:40.339
An episode just passed,

139
06:40.740 --> 06:42.820
so she's slowly stabilizing now.

140
06:43.339 --> 06:44.459
But she doesn't remember

141
06:44.500 --> 06:45.299
anything

142
06:45.380 --> 06:46.060
she did earlier.

143
06:47.020 --> 06:48.099
She looks fine right now,

144
06:48.859 --> 06:49.940
but when an episode hits,

145
06:51.779 --> 06:52.500
it's really...

146
07:13.500 --> 07:13.820
Dad,

147
07:14.339 --> 07:14.940
what happened?

148
07:15.779 --> 07:16.539
An episode hits.

149
07:17.459 --> 07:18.299
Guang is with her.

150
07:19.539 --> 07:20.180
It's okay.

151
07:20.620 --> 07:21.979
Don't be afraid.

152
07:22.500 --> 07:22.820
Be good.

153
07:23.459 --> 07:24.060
Sleep now.

154
07:24.820 --> 07:25.339
I'm here.

155
07:33.820 --> 07:34.659
How is Xin?

156
07:35.940 --> 07:36.779
I finally managed

157
07:36.779 --> 07:37.620
to get her to sleep.

158
07:37.859 --> 07:38.580
Don't go in.

159
07:38.820 --> 07:39.500
You'd wake her.

160
07:39.979 --> 07:41.060
Get some iodine

161
07:41.219 --> 07:41.979
for his wounds.

162
07:42.620 --> 07:42.940
Okay.

163
07:43.180 --> 07:43.740
No need.

164
07:44.740 --> 07:45.659
I have thick skin.

165
07:45.779 --> 07:47.419
It's just like a cat scratch.

166
07:47.820 --> 07:48.299
I'm fine.

167
07:49.299 --> 07:49.740
By the way,

168
07:50.260 --> 07:51.140
you said you met

169
07:51.219 --> 07:53.020
Xin's friends in the park.

170
07:53.260 --> 07:53.940
Who are they?

171
07:55.219 --> 07:56.180
I don't know them.

172
07:56.539 --> 07:57.299
A man and a woman.

173
07:57.620 --> 07:58.459
But Miss Weng

174
07:58.580 --> 07:59.539
recognized the woman.

175
08:01.140 --> 08:01.419
Yeah.

176
08:01.940 --> 08:02.659
She said

177
08:02.859 --> 08:04.020
she's Weng Yue's friend.

178
08:06.180 --> 08:07.060
My friend?

179
08:07.940 --> 08:08.820
I wonder what she

180
08:08.940 --> 08:10.260
said to Xin.

181
08:10.779 --> 08:12.140
Her episode had just ended,

182
08:12.940 --> 08:14.020
so it shouldn't have...

183
08:14.459 --> 08:15.740
It's all my fault.

184
08:16.459 --> 08:16.859
I should

185
08:16.979 --> 08:18.140
spend more time with her

186
08:18.500 --> 08:19.500
and watch over her.

187
08:19.979 --> 08:21.099
None of us wants

188
08:21.419 --> 08:23.099
to see Xin like this.

189
08:24.260 --> 08:25.620
You've already done so much.

190
08:26.260 --> 08:27.299
You talk to her

191
08:27.459 --> 08:28.260
every day,

192
08:28.820 --> 08:29.899
and never lose your temper.

193
08:31.459 --> 08:32.939
You're the pillar of this family.

194
08:33.500 --> 08:34.419
Stay strong.

195
08:34.819 --> 08:35.860
Don't get depressed.

196
08:37.100 --> 08:37.899
Don't worry, Dad.

197
08:38.579 --> 08:40.380
Even if the rest of the world get depressed,

198
08:40.500 --> 08:41.299
I never will.

199
08:42.220 --> 08:44.059
I have to help Xin recover.

200
08:47.539 --> 08:48.059
Let me do it.

201
08:58.740 --> 08:59.299
Xin,

202
09:01.380 --> 09:02.419
I often think

203
09:03.579 --> 09:05.059
of the day we first met.

204
09:06.340 --> 09:06.899
At that time,

205
09:07.899 --> 09:08.659
I was just

206
09:08.740 --> 09:10.020
a contractor of door frames.

207
09:11.140 --> 09:12.539
Your villa was being renovated,

208
09:13.899 --> 09:15.220
and I came to take measurements.

209
09:18.779 --> 09:19.860
I loved you at first sight.

210
09:23.579 --> 09:24.939
Your dad shopped around

211
09:25.419 --> 09:26.140
and thought

212
09:27.340 --> 09:29.659
my prices were honest and reasonable.

213
09:30.539 --> 09:31.699
He tested me over and over.

214
09:34.260 --> 09:34.860
Later on,

215
09:36.340 --> 09:37.579
before the renovation finished,

216
09:38.699 --> 09:39.860
your dad invited me

217
09:40.100 --> 09:41.500
to work at your family's company.

218
09:45.659 --> 09:46.500
Although

219
09:47.819 --> 09:48.899
I'm just a rough guy,

220
09:51.419 --> 09:52.340
I can't help

221
09:52.340 --> 09:53.899
saying something cheesy.

222
09:54.699 --> 09:55.699
Meeting you

223
09:57.020 --> 09:58.819
was truly the luckiest thing

224
10:01.740 --> 10:02.939
in my entire life.

225
10:33.579 --> 10:34.260
I have photos

226
10:34.380 --> 10:35.659
of Han Guang and Weng Xin.

227
10:35.779 --> 10:36.779
I'll distract the caregiver,

228
10:36.899 --> 10:38.020
and you'll find the chance

229
10:38.140 --> 10:39.340
to talk to Weng Xin

230
10:40.100 --> 10:41.500
about her past

231
10:41.539 --> 10:42.140
with Han Guang.

232
10:46.059 --> 10:47.059
You have photos of him

233
10:47.340 --> 10:48.579
from his contractor days?

234
10:49.220 --> 10:50.460
He never hid that part.

235
10:50.939 --> 10:52.419
It's his way of getting close

236
10:52.419 --> 10:53.059
to people.

237
10:54.020 --> 10:55.260
He even criticized

238
10:55.260 --> 10:56.340
Jiali's doors and windows,

239
10:56.460 --> 10:57.419
letting you change them.

240
10:59.579 --> 10:59.980
She's here.

241
11:00.980 --> 11:01.699
I told you two

242
11:01.779 --> 11:03.299
to mind your own business.

243
11:04.299 --> 11:04.699
Yu Meng,

244
11:05.380 --> 11:05.939
how about

245
11:05.980 --> 11:06.659
your own mess?

246
11:07.260 --> 11:08.059
Aren't you divorcing

247
11:08.100 --> 11:08.740
Di Liren?

248
11:09.380 --> 11:10.179
Why meddling in

249
11:10.260 --> 11:11.539
my family's affairs?

250
11:16.380 --> 11:17.179
Actually,

251
11:17.620 --> 11:18.939
I did it for my divorce.

252
11:20.179 --> 11:21.340
Want to hear

253
11:21.659 --> 11:22.419
a story?

254
11:28.500 --> 11:29.620
So you suspect

255
11:30.380 --> 11:31.340
my sister

256
11:32.059 --> 11:33.059
was deliberately framed

257
11:33.179 --> 11:34.260
as mentally ill,

258
11:34.260 --> 11:35.020
just like you?

259
11:35.620 --> 11:36.380
Haven't you

260
11:36.860 --> 11:37.779
ever suspected it?

261
11:42.860 --> 11:43.299
Yes.

262
11:45.299 --> 11:46.299
I asked my dad once.

263
11:48.179 --> 11:49.220
But without proof,

264
11:49.659 --> 11:51.059
it would only arouse suspicion

265
11:51.299 --> 11:52.100
and alert Han Guang.

266
11:52.579 --> 11:53.460
That's why

267
11:54.020 --> 11:54.819
I've been trying

268
11:54.860 --> 11:55.779
to get inside the company.

269
11:56.579 --> 11:57.380
Our family business

270
11:57.419 --> 11:58.380
can't be into his hands.

271
12:00.860 --> 12:02.299
Han Guang is our common enemy.

272
12:02.939 --> 12:03.899
You mean...

273
12:04.340 --> 12:05.260
I want to use Han Guang

274
12:05.500 --> 12:06.220
to keep Di Liren in check.

275
12:06.939 --> 12:07.659
I think

276
12:08.299 --> 12:09.059
we can cooperate.

277
12:11.299 --> 12:13.220
I might not help you much.

278
12:14.100 --> 12:15.100
At Yaoyan,

279
12:15.100 --> 12:16.100
I don't hold real power.

280
12:16.899 --> 12:18.100
My dad trusts Han Guang.

281
12:18.980 --> 12:20.260
Han Guang holds no shares,

282
12:20.539 --> 12:21.419
but as long as

283
12:21.500 --> 12:22.179
he doesn't

284
12:22.299 --> 12:23.380
cross the line,

285
12:23.980 --> 12:24.899
my dad rarely cares.

286
12:26.340 --> 12:27.380
So,

287
12:27.740 --> 12:28.899
we must first find

288
12:28.980 --> 12:29.779
Han Guang's weakness

289
12:30.620 --> 12:31.460
to bring him down.

290
12:32.519 --> 12:34.261
(Graduation Photo of Jiangzhou University Law Department Class of 2018)

291
12:45.179 --> 12:45.699
Xu,

292
12:47.419 --> 12:48.819
I have something to ask you.

293
12:49.299 --> 12:50.340
You don't seem to up

294
12:50.500 --> 12:51.539
to something good.

295
12:52.659 --> 12:54.020
But can I ask

296
12:54.059 --> 12:55.380
why you always come to me?

297
12:56.179 --> 12:57.059
You're the only one

298
12:57.059 --> 12:57.860
being honest to me,

299
12:58.419 --> 12:59.100
willing

300
12:59.100 --> 12:59.980
to take me

301
13:00.179 --> 13:00.939
to Meng's place,

302
13:01.899 --> 13:02.500
and

303
13:03.100 --> 13:03.860
treating me like a man.

304
13:05.340 --> 13:06.460
What do you want to know?

305
13:06.899 --> 13:07.579
I want to know

306
13:09.100 --> 13:10.140
what my dad did.

307
13:15.299 --> 13:16.419
I can't tell you that.

308
13:17.179 --> 13:18.179
Yu Meng and your mom

309
13:18.220 --> 13:19.059
would kill me.

310
13:20.779 --> 13:21.579
Just tell me

311
13:21.779 --> 13:22.699
what I can know,

312
13:22.740 --> 13:23.220
alright?

313
13:30.539 --> 13:31.419
I just remembered

314
13:31.740 --> 13:32.699
I need to go for a bit.

315
13:37.380 --> 13:38.579
On my desk are Jiali Cosmetics'

316
13:38.579 --> 13:39.179
financial statements,

317
13:39.340 --> 13:40.059
and on my computer

318
13:40.100 --> 13:41.299
is my analysis.

319
13:41.740 --> 13:42.100
However,

320
13:42.460 --> 13:43.699
you can only read internal

321
13:43.699 --> 13:44.380
business data,

322
13:44.860 --> 13:45.659
excluding anything

323
13:45.819 --> 13:46.539
confidential.

324
13:47.620 --> 13:48.140
Understood.

325
14:04.752 --> 14:05.813
(Analysis on Financial Irregularities)

326
14:08.407 --> 14:09.240
(Significant Financial Data Anomalies)

327
14:18.140 --> 14:18.939
Ai.

328
14:19.100 --> 14:20.299
Long time no see!

329
14:20.579 --> 14:21.419
Your last return

330
14:21.419 --> 14:22.419
was for Meng's wedding.

331
14:22.620 --> 14:23.620
And this time,

332
14:23.939 --> 14:24.699
you're marrying.

333
14:25.659 --> 14:26.220
I'm the last

334
14:26.340 --> 14:27.260
from our class

335
14:27.299 --> 14:28.299
to get married.

336
14:29.860 --> 14:31.179
Meng had to work today.

337
14:31.260 --> 14:31.819
She asked me

338
14:31.899 --> 14:32.980
to bring you this gift.

339
14:33.059 --> 14:33.779
Happy wedding!

340
14:34.220 --> 14:34.819
Thank you!

341
14:35.620 --> 14:36.340
Come in and chat.

342
14:36.500 --> 14:36.939
Sure.

343
14:39.860 --> 14:40.299
Let me introduce.

344
14:40.579 --> 14:41.059
My husband.

345
14:42.860 --> 14:43.659
Mr. Hedgehog!

346
14:44.620 --> 14:45.140
Chestnut.

347
14:45.340 --> 14:46.020
Following me

348
14:46.059 --> 14:47.059
all the way here?

349
14:47.299 --> 14:48.059
This is a private

350
14:48.059 --> 14:48.860
event.

351
14:49.100 --> 14:49.659
I don't know

352
14:49.659 --> 14:50.860
what you're thinking.

353
14:51.059 --> 14:51.699
You got me wrong.

354
14:52.140 --> 14:52.579
He's my friend.

355
14:52.860 --> 14:54.539
We were college roommates.

356
14:55.500 --> 14:56.779
You two know each other?

357
14:58.699 --> 14:59.260
Yes.

358
14:59.819 --> 15:00.699
What a coincidence.

359
15:01.539 --> 15:02.659
Thank you, everyone.

360
15:02.819 --> 15:04.579
- Happy wedding! - Happy wedding!

361
15:07.939 --> 15:09.659
- Have a seat. - Please sit.

362
15:11.020 --> 15:11.579
Actually,

363
15:11.939 --> 15:13.579
I've always wanted to thank Liu Zi.

364
15:13.939 --> 15:14.980
Why thank me?

365
15:15.340 --> 15:17.100
If it weren't for you,

366
15:17.299 --> 15:17.860
I

367
15:18.460 --> 15:19.659
wouldn't have met my husband.

368
15:20.140 --> 15:21.620
Then I really have to thank

369
15:21.620 --> 15:22.539
my buddy.

370
15:22.579 --> 15:23.579
Without you,

371
15:23.819 --> 15:25.579
I wouldn't have met my wife.

372
15:26.939 --> 15:27.740
What do you mean?

373
15:28.059 --> 15:28.819
Did you forget?

374
15:29.419 --> 15:30.140
Eight years ago,

375
15:30.659 --> 15:31.340
you didn't want

376
15:31.380 --> 15:32.260
to go to the date

377
15:32.539 --> 15:33.179
your family set up.

378
15:33.620 --> 15:34.740
You covered

379
15:34.899 --> 15:36.179
three days of my shifts,

380
15:36.460 --> 15:38.140
begging me to go in your place.

381
15:39.539 --> 15:40.980
You two met that day?

382
15:41.260 --> 15:41.980
Bingo!

383
15:42.539 --> 15:44.779
You refused to go on the date

384
15:45.059 --> 15:46.100
and ran my experiment.

385
15:46.579 --> 15:47.020
So,

386
15:47.140 --> 15:48.779
the blind date was actually set up for...

387
15:51.140 --> 15:53.100
Mom, I need to use the restroom.

388
15:53.460 --> 15:55.059
Okay, let's go.

389
15:58.059 --> 15:58.899
Please sit.

390
16:00.740 --> 16:01.579
Eat up.

391
16:02.500 --> 16:03.140
So you see,

392
16:03.220 --> 16:05.620
fate works in mysterious ways.

393
16:06.020 --> 16:07.059
Eight years ago,

394
16:07.220 --> 16:08.539
the blind date was for you two.

395
16:09.380 --> 16:10.779
If both of you

396
16:10.860 --> 16:13.179
had gone to the blind date,

397
16:13.819 --> 16:16.260
would you two be the ones getting married today?

398
16:16.380 --> 16:16.740
No.

399
16:17.460 --> 16:18.100
Are you sure?

400
16:19.380 --> 16:20.100
Answer me

401
16:20.620 --> 16:21.579
after thinking it over.

402
16:22.299 --> 16:23.460
I did

403
16:23.620 --> 16:24.380
think it over.

404
16:24.939 --> 16:25.539
Even if

405
16:25.539 --> 16:26.659
I had gone to the date,

406
16:26.980 --> 16:27.380
I wouldn't

407
16:27.380 --> 16:28.179
meet Liu Zi,

408
16:28.380 --> 16:29.699
but her friend, your wife.

409
16:29.939 --> 16:30.819
And even if Liu Zi

410
16:30.939 --> 16:32.380
had gone to the date herself,

411
16:32.779 --> 16:34.140
and I met Liu Zi that day,

412
16:34.380 --> 16:35.260
we wouldn't end well.

413
16:37.380 --> 16:38.740
Why are you so certain?

414
16:40.620 --> 16:41.140
Mom,

415
16:41.419 --> 16:42.620
where are the wipes?

416
16:43.779 --> 16:44.819
I will buy you new ones.

417
16:45.100 --> 16:45.659
Why?

418
16:46.939 --> 16:47.699
I was about

419
16:47.699 --> 16:48.419
to fly to Germany.

420
16:48.819 --> 16:49.299
I can't be

421
16:49.340 --> 16:50.140
in a long-distance

422
16:50.299 --> 16:51.340
relationship

423
16:51.500 --> 16:52.020
with a girl.

424
16:52.699 --> 16:53.380
How ruthless!

425
16:53.539 --> 16:54.500
Come on,

426
16:54.659 --> 16:55.419
get to the point

427
16:55.500 --> 16:56.939
when you talk.

428
16:57.260 --> 16:58.020
The groom's friend

429
16:58.020 --> 16:58.699
is so charming.

430
16:58.860 --> 17:00.059
I want to get his number.

431
17:00.579 --> 17:02.100
His name is Kang Long, I guess.

432
17:02.740 --> 17:04.420
I took a look at him.

433
17:04.980 --> 17:06.180
He's really charming.

434
17:06.460 --> 17:07.260
I wonder

435
17:07.299 --> 17:08.260
if he has a girlfriend.

436
17:08.420 --> 17:09.900
I don't know if he has a girlfriend,

437
17:09.940 --> 17:10.940
but he does have a son,

438
17:11.059 --> 17:11.660
ten years old,

439
17:11.900 --> 17:12.579
(Meng) in Germany.

440
17:12.940 --> 17:14.500
He probably dumped him on the mother

441
17:14.740 --> 17:15.940
and came back to live it up.

442
17:17.299 --> 17:17.980
Scumbag!

443
17:18.539 --> 17:19.020
Let's go.

444
17:21.020 --> 17:22.859
Spreading rumors about others

445
17:22.940 --> 17:23.900
isn't very nice.

446
17:24.099 --> 17:25.299
I just saved an innocent girl

447
17:25.460 --> 17:27.260
from falling

448
17:27.379 --> 17:28.460
into a scumbag's trap.

449
17:28.779 --> 17:30.180
I'm doing good deeds here.

450
17:30.940 --> 17:32.819
Right. I think the same.

451
17:33.980 --> 17:35.420
Don't worry, Good Samaritan.

452
17:35.779 --> 17:37.139
You'll meet someone better.

453
17:37.779 --> 17:39.099
I really admire you.

454
17:39.260 --> 17:40.339
You haven't given up

455
17:40.379 --> 17:41.059
on men yet?

456
17:41.619 --> 17:42.099
With no men,

457
17:42.099 --> 17:43.660
I can still live a great life.

458
17:44.059 --> 17:44.779
Besides,

459
17:45.660 --> 17:47.379
a mature and confident person

460
17:47.460 --> 17:48.260
doesn't get paranoid

461
17:48.339 --> 17:49.339
about happiness.

462
17:50.099 --> 17:50.859
Why does that

463
17:50.940 --> 17:52.299
sound so familiar?

464
17:52.980 --> 17:54.420
I posted it on Lucky Beauty Yu

465
17:54.420 --> 17:55.020
days ago.

466
17:56.819 --> 17:57.859
Thanks for coming.

467
17:58.139 --> 17:59.099
Keep in touch.

468
17:59.139 --> 17:59.700
By the way,

469
17:59.859 --> 18:00.660
when do you plan

470
18:00.660 --> 18:01.619
to bring your son back?

471
18:01.779 --> 18:02.180
Soon.

472
18:02.660 --> 18:03.099
Su.

473
18:03.619 --> 18:04.099
Leaving?

474
18:04.139 --> 18:04.619
Time to go.

475
18:05.859 --> 18:07.299
Does it need shots to fly back?

476
18:07.539 --> 18:08.940
It gets shots every year.

477
18:09.139 --> 18:10.299
Flying is a problem now.

478
18:10.500 --> 18:12.099
Don't they have that

479
18:12.180 --> 18:14.059
in-cabin pet service now?

480
18:14.180 --> 18:15.539
Find someone to fly with the dog.

481
18:15.700 --> 18:16.779
Yeah, I plan to do that.

482
18:17.539 --> 18:19.180
Your son is a dog?

483
18:19.460 --> 18:20.299
W-What else?

484
18:20.660 --> 18:21.660
What kind of dog?

485
18:21.900 --> 18:23.099
I love dogs!

486
18:23.700 --> 18:25.020
Come, Chestnut, let me show you.

487
18:26.099 --> 18:26.500
Look.

488
18:27.180 --> 18:28.299
This is my dog.

489
18:28.819 --> 18:29.220
See?

490
18:30.020 --> 18:30.859
Once I bring it back,

491
18:31.020 --> 18:31.779
I'll show you.

492
18:32.059 --> 18:32.539
Okay.

493
18:32.859 --> 18:33.460
The next one.

494
18:33.619 --> 18:34.059
Ai,

495
18:34.420 --> 18:35.059
I think

496
18:35.139 --> 18:35.940
I have to go now.

497
18:36.180 --> 18:37.059
I'm leaving then.

498
18:37.660 --> 18:38.139
Sure.

499
18:38.180 --> 18:38.859
See you then.

500
18:39.940 --> 18:40.460
Its nose...

501
18:41.779 --> 18:42.619
Say thank you.

502
18:43.460 --> 18:44.500
Thank you!

503
18:45.059 --> 18:45.740
Bye.

504
19:02.460 --> 19:03.819
My parents are already waiting.

505
19:04.619 --> 19:04.980
Okay.

506
19:08.379 --> 19:09.139
What would you like

507
19:09.500 --> 19:10.700
to know more about today?

508
19:11.900 --> 19:13.460
I just want a general overview.

509
19:13.940 --> 19:14.779
The reputation

510
19:14.940 --> 19:15.740
of our center

511
19:15.740 --> 19:16.980
is among the best.

512
19:17.260 --> 19:17.619
Besides,

513
19:17.660 --> 19:18.579
our medical staff

514
19:18.660 --> 19:20.339
consists of highly experienced

515
19:20.539 --> 19:22.139
professionals.

516
19:22.900 --> 19:23.539
This way.

517
19:23.819 --> 19:24.819
I'll show you

518
19:24.859 --> 19:25.460
around.

519
19:27.180 --> 19:28.139
I'm sorry, Miss Weng.

520
19:28.420 --> 19:29.460
Only family members

521
19:29.539 --> 19:30.539
may visit.

522
19:30.700 --> 19:31.779
You may go in,

523
19:31.940 --> 19:32.900
but not this gentleman.

524
19:33.460 --> 19:34.299
All for the patient's

525
19:34.299 --> 19:35.260
well-being.

526
19:36.020 --> 19:36.579
Sorry.

527
19:41.260 --> 19:41.819
Take a look.

528
19:41.980 --> 19:43.180
This is our central courtyard.

529
19:43.619 --> 19:45.220
It's very open,

530
19:45.740 --> 19:46.779
with nice views.

531
19:47.059 --> 19:47.460
Sometimes,

532
19:47.579 --> 19:49.020
we gather people here

533
19:49.260 --> 19:50.500
for book clubs

534
19:50.700 --> 19:51.379
and concerts.

535
19:53.020 --> 19:53.700
(Strict security.)

536
19:53.980 --> 19:55.139
(I can't get in.)

537
19:57.859 --> 19:58.900
(Han Guang sent her here)

538
19:59.339 --> 20:00.660
(to prevent outsiders)

539
20:00.980 --> 20:02.139
(from getting near her.)

540
20:08.539 --> 20:09.500
(What should I do now?)

541
20:13.779 --> 20:15.020
(I had a backup plan.)

542
20:35.423 --> 20:36.260
(A few days ago)

543
20:36.260 --> 20:37.059
Let's have a talk.

544
20:37.700 --> 20:38.299
What happened?

545
20:38.619 --> 20:39.379
Di Liren reported

546
20:39.379 --> 20:40.139
my application.

547
20:40.539 --> 20:41.660
He wants Haoyu's trust fund.

548
20:42.299 --> 20:43.020
I won't let him.

549
20:43.819 --> 20:44.779
You're getting divorced.

550
20:45.700 --> 20:46.460
I can help you

551
20:47.379 --> 20:48.579
get the terms you want.

552
20:49.500 --> 20:50.619
I'll do anything you ask.

553
20:51.700 --> 20:52.619
But in exchange,

554
20:53.619 --> 20:54.940
get rid of Di Liren,

555
20:55.500 --> 20:56.460
so I can go with Haoyu.

556
20:57.539 --> 20:58.460
What's your plan?

557
20:59.579 --> 21:00.940
I have a way to handle Di Liren,

558
21:01.740 --> 21:03.339
but Han Guang is a loose cannon.

559
21:04.020 --> 21:05.059
I need to make sure

560
21:05.099 --> 21:05.700
he won't take

561
21:05.700 --> 21:06.740
Di Liren's side.

562
21:08.500 --> 21:08.940
Wonderful.

563
21:10.180 --> 21:11.420
He's been causing me trouble.

564
21:12.260 --> 21:13.420
We have a common enemy then.

565
21:14.940 --> 21:16.859
Have you made up your mind?

566
21:17.660 --> 21:18.779
I've been in this mess

567
21:19.859 --> 21:21.260
for twenty years.

568
21:22.420 --> 21:23.900
I don't want to be in this mess

569
21:24.900 --> 21:25.579
with Di Liren

570
21:25.579 --> 21:26.700
anymore.

571
21:27.619 --> 21:28.099
Okay.

572
21:29.379 --> 21:30.059
I understand.

573
21:33.420 --> 21:34.260
What's your plan?

574
21:35.619 --> 21:36.819
Han Guang and Di Liren

575
21:36.900 --> 21:37.980
actually aren't that close.

576
21:38.900 --> 21:40.139
You want to use the shares

577
21:40.460 --> 21:41.460
to let them fight.

578
21:42.420 --> 21:43.139
I can help you.

579
21:43.900 --> 21:44.859
Then pleasure

580
21:46.539 --> 21:47.660
working with you again.

581
22:05.099 --> 22:06.220
Thought you might want food,

582
22:07.500 --> 22:08.379
so I brought some.

583
22:09.013 --> 22:09.891
(Food and Love Never Fail)

584
22:10.220 --> 22:10.980
I already ate.

585
22:13.700 --> 22:14.379
How did it go?

586
22:15.099 --> 22:15.500
Exhausted?

587
22:18.500 --> 22:20.779
The medication has kept Weng Xin

588
22:21.059 --> 22:21.940
completely drowsy.

589
22:22.700 --> 22:23.500
I can't get

590
22:23.539 --> 22:24.579
anything from her.

591
22:25.500 --> 22:26.139
I managed

592
22:26.220 --> 22:27.339
to get her medical records,

593
22:28.379 --> 22:29.539
but I need time to inspect.

594
22:30.299 --> 22:31.940
We still lack solid proof

595
22:31.980 --> 22:33.819
that Han Guang is mentally controlling her.

596
22:34.099 --> 22:35.180
Weng Yue connected you

597
22:35.220 --> 22:36.099
to the Weng family,

598
22:36.940 --> 22:37.819
but mind your words

599
22:37.859 --> 22:38.660
when speaking

600
22:38.819 --> 22:39.859
with her parents,

601
22:39.980 --> 22:40.859
or it'd alert Han Guang.

602
22:43.619 --> 22:44.059
Got it.

603
22:49.059 --> 22:49.980
Let's go to a place,

604
22:50.539 --> 22:51.299
just to thank you.

605
23:07.700 --> 23:08.779
Why did you bring me here?

606
23:11.020 --> 23:12.579
Playing spy all day

607
23:12.819 --> 23:13.579
must be tense.

608
23:14.139 --> 23:14.819
Take a breath.

609
23:16.260 --> 23:17.500
Don't you think the view here

610
23:17.619 --> 23:18.220
is stunning?

611
23:21.420 --> 23:22.779
I don't have the time for that.

612
23:24.260 --> 23:25.020
Have a drink.

613
23:25.579 --> 23:26.339
Especially for you.

614
23:26.940 --> 23:27.819
Want to drunk drive?

615
23:29.460 --> 23:30.339
Don't worry.

616
23:30.940 --> 23:31.900
I ordered a driver.

617
23:33.500 --> 23:34.859
We've both been through a lot,

618
23:35.779 --> 23:37.299
and finally see some hope.

619
23:37.460 --> 23:38.819
Let's celebrate with a drink.

620
23:55.700 --> 23:56.700
Aren't you happy?

621
23:57.740 --> 23:58.420
We're getting rid

622
23:58.420 --> 23:59.299
of the same man.

623
24:00.940 --> 24:01.460
Not yet.

624
24:04.660 --> 24:06.139
Heard of the law of attraction?

625
24:06.619 --> 24:08.220
Good things will only happen

626
24:08.379 --> 24:09.660
when you believe they will.

627
24:10.420 --> 24:10.859
Come on.

628
24:12.059 --> 24:12.779
Imagine this.

629
24:13.619 --> 24:15.099
Once you're totally rid of Di Liren,

630
24:15.819 --> 24:16.539
what would you do?

631
24:19.379 --> 24:20.420
I...

632
24:25.500 --> 24:26.180
I'll go first.

633
24:28.420 --> 24:29.460
Many years ago,

634
24:30.299 --> 24:31.779
when my dad started Jiali,

635
24:32.379 --> 24:33.460
he made a balm

636
24:33.819 --> 24:34.539
called Haomeng.

637
24:35.180 --> 24:35.940
You might not know.

638
24:36.420 --> 24:36.900
I do.

639
24:38.859 --> 24:39.940
That product was

640
24:40.099 --> 24:40.980
discontinued for long.

641
24:42.059 --> 24:42.740
But when I

642
24:42.740 --> 24:43.740
browsed a thrift market,

643
24:44.339 --> 24:45.260
I found that someone

644
24:45.819 --> 24:46.420
has been trying

645
24:46.500 --> 24:47.339
to collect this balm

646
24:48.379 --> 24:49.500
and replicate it.

647
24:52.180 --> 24:53.460
I never thought

648
24:54.379 --> 24:55.099
a dream

649
24:55.819 --> 24:57.059
could be in someone's memory

650
24:57.180 --> 24:57.859
for so long.

651
24:58.379 --> 24:59.260
When I open it,

652
25:00.579 --> 25:01.700
it's the smell of childhood.

653
25:04.260 --> 25:05.180
You want to remake it?

654
25:05.740 --> 25:06.099
Exactly.

655
25:07.619 --> 25:09.099
I want to bring it back.

656
25:10.059 --> 25:10.859
However,

657
25:11.500 --> 25:13.379
I want to produce Haomeng 2.0.

658
25:14.700 --> 25:15.859
I want to express

659
25:15.859 --> 25:16.660
what it means to me.

660
25:21.180 --> 25:22.099
Done. Your turn.

661
25:23.099 --> 25:24.339
What is your dream?

662
25:26.460 --> 25:27.500
My dream?

663
25:31.220 --> 25:31.900
Open a small shop

664
25:33.579 --> 25:34.779
and live a peaceful life.

665
25:40.900 --> 25:41.779
That's a lovely dream.

666
25:42.900 --> 25:44.579
It may sound ordinary,

667
25:45.139 --> 25:45.700
but it's what

668
25:45.740 --> 25:47.020
many people yearn for.

669
25:48.579 --> 25:49.020
By the way,

670
25:49.700 --> 25:50.779
you could go to the UK

671
25:50.819 --> 25:51.740
to open a clinic.

672
25:53.059 --> 25:53.579
No way.

673
25:53.859 --> 25:55.139
You need a medical license.

674
25:55.940 --> 25:57.420
You could open

675
25:57.740 --> 25:58.660
a massage center,

676
25:59.579 --> 26:00.059
to do moxibustion.

677
26:00.700 --> 26:01.859
A lot of people

678
26:02.099 --> 26:03.220
open those abroad now.

679
26:03.420 --> 26:04.180
Good business.

680
26:05.420 --> 26:07.020
But that's physical labor.

681
26:07.420 --> 26:08.500
Might be pretty exhausting.

682
26:09.660 --> 26:10.740
Every job is exhausting.

683
26:11.660 --> 26:13.059
My dad always said that.

684
26:13.779 --> 26:14.700
Your dad was right.

685
26:15.500 --> 26:16.660
If you don't work hard,

686
26:16.980 --> 26:18.099
your mind suffers.

687
26:18.379 --> 26:20.139
When my dad went to school,

688
26:21.180 --> 26:22.619
he left home at 4:30 AM.

689
26:23.619 --> 26:25.139
He walked and walked,

690
26:26.379 --> 26:28.180
all the way to town for class.

691
26:28.660 --> 26:29.940
He just kept walking,

692
26:31.299 --> 26:32.740
from fields to the city,

693
26:34.139 --> 26:35.740
from dirt roads to paved streets,

694
26:36.220 --> 26:37.460
from having nothing at all

695
26:38.099 --> 26:39.299
to running a factory.

696
26:40.500 --> 26:41.579
He always told me

697
26:43.579 --> 26:45.220
it doesn't matter if it's still dark out.

698
26:47.299 --> 26:48.099
If you keep walking,

699
26:49.660 --> 26:50.379
dawn will break.

700
26:53.020 --> 26:53.940
