37:46.179 --> 37:47.380
She was his counselor

1048
37:47.539 --> 37:48.739
and his direct senior.

1049
37:49.020 --> 37:50.139
No wonder he cares so much

1050
37:50.259 --> 37:50.900
about her.

1051
37:51.340 --> 37:51.940
Could you

1052
37:52.099 --> 37:53.179
pass along my apologies?

1053
37:53.420 --> 37:54.179
(Graduation Photo of Jiangzhou University Law Department Class of 2018) I was

1054
37:54.219 --> 37:55.300
so rude to him earlier.

1055
38:06.579 --> 38:07.179
Sorry.

1056
38:07.460 --> 38:08.380
I'm not suited

1057
38:08.420 --> 38:09.500
to handle your divorce.

1058
38:09.739 --> 38:10.659
Hire another lawyer.

1059
38:18.980 --> 38:19.699
Why are you here?

1060
38:22.340 --> 38:23.219
What kind of case?

1061
38:23.539 --> 38:25.579
Even you are

1062
38:25.860 --> 38:27.179
turning it down?

1063
38:27.780 --> 38:28.380
I can also

1064
38:28.500 --> 38:29.780
choose not to take a case.

1065
38:30.139 --> 38:31.219
She didn't tell the truth.

1066
38:31.460 --> 38:32.539
If a client hides things

1067
38:32.539 --> 38:33.340
from their lawyer,

1068
38:33.940 --> 38:34.739
it won't work then.

1069
38:35.340 --> 38:36.539
Why is that?

1070
38:36.659 --> 38:37.940
First, I won't take the case.

1071
38:38.340 --> 38:38.820
Second,

1072
38:39.139 --> 38:40.619
the case won't get far,

1073
38:40.820 --> 38:41.739
as you'll get blindsided

1074
38:41.739 --> 38:42.300
by the evidence.

1075
38:42.699 --> 38:43.780
I dislike that the most.

1076
38:44.780 --> 38:45.780
What if the lawyer

1077
38:46.659 --> 38:48.020
hides things from their client?

1078
38:50.259 --> 38:51.699
That rarely happens.

1079
38:52.099 --> 38:52.619
A lawyer

1080
38:52.659 --> 38:53.900
shall serve the client.

1081
38:54.780 --> 38:55.699
I always lay out

1082
38:55.699 --> 38:56.420
the worst result

1083
38:56.659 --> 38:57.300
in advance.

1084
38:57.739 --> 38:58.460
Why didn't you say

1085
38:58.500 --> 38:59.340
you know Weng Xin?

1086
39:07.020 --> 39:08.139
Tell me about it,

1087
39:08.780 --> 39:09.619
Mr. Jiao.

1088
39:17.781 --> 39:20.806
=The Vanishing Beauty= (Next Episode Preview)

1089
39:21.340 --> 39:22.300
You always forget

1090
39:22.579 --> 39:23.500
you can't leave me.

1091
39:24.259 --> 39:25.579
Haoyu has a USB right now

1092
39:26.059 --> 39:27.300
with our transaction records.

1093
39:27.619 --> 39:28.219
I want to know

1094
39:28.579 --> 39:30.020
what they have on us,

1095
39:30.340 --> 39:31.020
so I can prepare.

1096
39:31.300 --> 39:32.059
Why are you hiding?

1097
39:32.500 --> 39:33.259
Where are you going?

1098
39:33.380 --> 39:34.539
You tell me why I'm hiding.

1099
39:34.579 --> 39:35.420
Your son told me

1100
39:36.259 --> 39:36.860
to tell him

1101
39:36.860 --> 39:37.940
everything today

1102
39:38.219 --> 39:39.219
before giving me the USB.

1103
39:39.900 --> 39:40.739
How could I tell him?

1104
39:42.219 --> 39:42.739
Harry.

1105
39:43.179 --> 39:43.860
A birthday gift

1106
39:43.860 --> 39:44.579
for you.

1107
39:45.539 --> 39:45.940
Meng,

1108
39:46.780 --> 39:47.659
(Trust Beneficiary Right Transfer Agreement) I'll return all the money to you.

1109
39:48.539 --> 39:49.460
Can you spare my parents?

1110
40:04.956 --> 40:09.825
♪Old dreams have faded in color♪

1111
40:12.309 --> 40:17.172
♪A lonely heart torn in conflict♪

1112
40:19.630 --> 40:24.475
♪The love that stumbled along♪

1113
40:24.920 --> 40:31.422
♪Was just a quiet release♪

1114
40:34.154 --> 40:41.107
♪I write the future into a song, honoring the brave with no regrets♪

1115
40:41.657 --> 40:47.587
♪Turning all losses into the passion of this moment♪

1116
40:48.711 --> 40:55.942
♪I write the future into a song, for the me who never walks away♪

1117
40:56.245 --> 41:01.418
♪Forging all weaknesses into sharp, bold colors♪

1118
41:02.038 --> 41:13.506
♪In this life, I follow only my own choice♪

1119
41:16.006 --> 41:21.254
♪The chilled night has lost its color♪

1120
41:23.295 --> 41:28.730
♪No need to echo those who drifted apart♪

1121
41:30.552 --> 41:35.949
♪No longer proving my worth to anyone♪

1122
41:35.949 --> 41:44.594
♪The answer has long been etched in my silhouette♪

1123
41:45.070 --> 41:52.633
♪I write the future into a song, for the me who never walks away♪

1124
41:52.633 --> 41:58.479
♪Paving every twist and turn into a path forward♪

1125
41:58.479 --> 42:08.646
♪The ending of this life will be set by me♪
